[{:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-74525"] :question/problem "Consider the following system of linear equations:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x-2y+z=1 \\\\ 2x-y-z=-1 \\\\ -2x+4y-2z=-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the standard Gauss-Jordan method to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to reduced row echelon form." :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ -2 & 4 & -2 & -2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTransforming $M$ to reduced row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ -2 & 4 & -2 & -2\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 3 & -3 & -3 \\\\ -2 & 4 & -2 & -2\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 3 & -3 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :=\\frac{1}{3}{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn the row echelon form above, we have only two pivots (in the $1$st and $2$nd columns). To transform the matrix to reduced row echelon form, we need to create zeros above the pivots only. This gives,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}+2{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-74536"] :question/problem "Consider the following system of linear equations:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}-x-y-3z=1 \\\\ 2x+2y+6z=-2 \\\\ -2x-2y-6z=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the standard Gauss-Jordan method to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to reduced row echelon form." :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & -1 & -3 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 2 & 6 & -2 \\\\ -2 & -2 & -6 & 2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTransforming $M$ to reduced row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}-1 & -1 & -3 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 2 & 6 & -2 \\\\ -2 & -2 & -6 & 2\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :=-{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 2 & 6 & -2 \\\\ -2 & -2 & -6 & 2\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -2 & -2 & -6 & 2\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-74626/selection/7a1847832dd3291a7085ef676f2a5b0247380b5ae60c49c4ccacecf9154e40df" :answer/id #uuid "6248ef27-5866-5c8b-b47f-40c045c98bb6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}10z-1 \\\\ 1-4z \\\\ z\\end{aligned}],\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74626/selection/c3aded765095704df58439cb992378a6e618281a38ae3e91203b651d5af9503e" :answer/id #uuid "02baac2c-af06-5b21-a8f0-55091168680c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}10z-1 \\\\ 1-4z \\\\ z+1\\end{aligned}],\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74626/selection/ba9afa20571cd8941e983a439160bd11448c074904b05da5875efe31ad8712c4" :answer/id #uuid "d624cfed-3c7d-5cfc-9396-74363c97c113" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}10z+1 \\\\ 1+4z \\\\ z+1\\end{aligned}],\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74626/selection/d35577b8d826cf580d54cd6dd9ef516fc8ce86c8b2890354e7738fb1c0ee0751" :answer/id #uuid "fcfc0de3-5798-5ef0-945e-82f606a677b8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}5z-1 \\\\ 1-2z \\\\ z\\end{aligned}],\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74626/selection/80242af49670a4f7aaf86bf04273fa4ae7d34aa103c59e3b5637567fb2c19a42" :answer/id #uuid "5da527d9-ebec-5f2b-a809-ed28f20b82bb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}5z-1 \\\\ 1-4z \\\\ z\\end{aligned}],\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74626/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "69bb13ef-7453-5057-baad-ebbd9c03da44" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-74626/selection/7a1847832dd3291a7085ef676f2a5b0247380b5ae60c49c4ccacecf9154e40df" :answer-field/choices ["q-74626/selection/7a1847832dd3291a7085ef676f2a5b0247380b5ae60c49c4ccacecf9154e40df" "q-74626/selection/c3aded765095704df58439cb992378a6e618281a38ae3e91203b651d5af9503e" "q-74626/selection/ba9afa20571cd8941e983a439160bd11448c074904b05da5875efe31ad8712c4" "q-74626/selection/d35577b8d826cf580d54cd6dd9ef516fc8ce86c8b2890354e7738fb1c0ee0751" "q-74626/selection/80242af49670a4f7aaf86bf04273fa4ae7d34aa103c59e3b5637567fb2c19a42"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-74626" :question/id #uuid "23bca3c5-322d-5c3f-a423-fb871cdd59a3" :question/math-academy-id "q-74626" :question/problem "Consider the following system of linear equations:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x+2y-2z=1 \\\\ -3x-6y+6z=-3 \\\\ 2x+5y=3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the standard Gauss-Jordan method to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to reduced row echelon form, and then solve the linear system." :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -2 & 1 \\\\ -3 & -6 & 6 & -3 \\\\ 2 & 5 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTransforming $M$ into reduced row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -2 & 1 \\\\ -3 & -6 & 6 & -3 \\\\ 2 & 5 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+3{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 5 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 4 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & ↔{R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 4 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn the row echelon form above, we have only two pivots (in the $1$st and $2$nd columns). To transform the matrix to reduced row echelon form, we need to create zeros above the pivots only. This gives,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 4 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}+(-2){R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & -10 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 4 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x-10z=-1 \\\\ y+4z=1 \\\\ 0=0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince any numbers $x,y,z$ form a solution of the final equation, we can remove this equation from the system. \n\nThe basic variables are the variables whose coefficients are pivots. In this case, the basic variables are $x$ and $y,$ and we have one free variable, $z.$ That means we need to find $x$ and $y$ in terms of $z.$ \n\nTherefore, the general solution is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x=10z-1 \\\\ y=1-4z \\\\ z=z,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $z$ (the free variable) is an arbitrary number.\n\nIn vector form, the solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}10z-1 \\\\ 1-4z \\\\ z\\end{aligned}],\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-74626/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b010a518-7aa3-5b53-9a6d-ef0779ff0dfa"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-74626"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-131603/selection/398a04aab28e4a6ee46494a669189c174a32ccc77021f53bb0e8f34d08a0dd5d" :answer/id #uuid "c3f8732e-e7be-5e7e-a8d4-4de651e0e90e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131603/selection/dea9d3856d920b13ccab2267dea6c538f739a1b7f389b537b2bbb3a0acecfcca" :answer/id #uuid "8e1f91ce-424d-5819-9e1e-17a040254bb6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131603/selection/00ccc9087f7dff9c0201570fb3c8cc102e760b310b9596e348581eeb8ef0eba0" :answer/id #uuid "010fed17-df22-5e1d-bb27-a5dfd69cba04" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & -8 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131603/selection/fd618a5c5cbaef917a2f4f78b5ffb8bf37b0b5e6331a832d96b6150a0b3d5735" :answer/id #uuid "60675cfa-567d-53f0-9c9d-b085e94e8c57" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & 9 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131603/selection/1179800886c7f4d8bccd167dc52069b5b2bfba82e4267cc3a9348d2e109df081" :answer/id #uuid "b1113364-061b-59df-a896-be9a17560fad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & -9 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131603/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "a16354a9-58f5-500f-9f4b-a8a6ff20f514" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-131603/selection/fd618a5c5cbaef917a2f4f78b5ffb8bf37b0b5e6331a832d96b6150a0b3d5735" :answer-field/choices ["q-131603/selection/398a04aab28e4a6ee46494a669189c174a32ccc77021f53bb0e8f34d08a0dd5d" "q-131603/selection/dea9d3856d920b13ccab2267dea6c538f739a1b7f389b537b2bbb3a0acecfcca" "q-131603/selection/00ccc9087f7dff9c0201570fb3c8cc102e760b310b9596e348581eeb8ef0eba0" "q-131603/selection/fd618a5c5cbaef917a2f4f78b5ffb8bf37b0b5e6331a832d96b6150a0b3d5735" "q-131603/selection/1179800886c7f4d8bccd167dc52069b5b2bfba82e4267cc3a9348d2e109df081"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-131603" :question/id #uuid "1bcacfc8-760b-5702-9297-34f70a805709" :question/math-academy-id "q-131603" :question/problem "Consider the following system of linear equations:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned} & 2x-4y+7z=-4 \\\\  & -x+3y-4z=5 \\\\  & x-2y+3z=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the standard Gauss-Jordan method to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to reduced row echelon form." :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -4 & 7 & -4 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -4 & 5 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 3 & -1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTransforming $M$ to reduced row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}2 & -4 & 7 & -4 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -4 & 5 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 3 & -1\\end{aligned}] &  & {R}_{1}↔{R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -4 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -4 & 7 & -4\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -4 & 7 & -4\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+{R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}+(-3){R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 0 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}+2{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & 9 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-131603/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "95a32907-8304-5dfd-8759-9e91503445bf"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-131603"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-131620/selection/24d6d2cea0db9b4fe81f723d89329b6b30511c1a0e981ba26e7dc2cbb4852f93" :answer/id #uuid "292cd9a3-8ef9-5963-98b0-51459dfbaa05" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & 23 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -3\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131620/selection/fc56c544e248dc1fe65ea274592028651ba566bb33f576c95dd07b1870938d7d" :answer/id #uuid "0c9062cc-89ef-521b-8487-4d54c11dff7c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & -23 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131620/selection/6c43de11ed8cf4df4b4e9a1c49b3429e7b5ace9454a73a407864f44f5852096a" :answer/id #uuid "212540d7-45ac-5571-808d-fc8ab7144978" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & -23 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131620/selection/eaf89b7a4978a2d5dff9207e095c5b4468c549526ae50152b76881aa88e39c25" :answer/id #uuid "e7bd333f-31b6-5b3b-947d-b3a81ce338f7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & -25 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -3\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131620/selection/1539229e458d355e21e88c2a6fb27d9d758077df151e24a4bac2e9b2b9fcc3da" :answer/id #uuid "016a61fa-9b50-5e71-a8b8-8d4b886186c8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & -25 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -3\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131620/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "79c247e0-237d-56a6-a2ce-8d09f7b06ad4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-131620/selection/fc56c544e248dc1fe65ea274592028651ba566bb33f576c95dd07b1870938d7d" :answer-field/choices ["q-131620/selection/24d6d2cea0db9b4fe81f723d89329b6b30511c1a0e981ba26e7dc2cbb4852f93" "q-131620/selection/fc56c544e248dc1fe65ea274592028651ba566bb33f576c95dd07b1870938d7d" "q-131620/selection/6c43de11ed8cf4df4b4e9a1c49b3429e7b5ace9454a73a407864f44f5852096a" "q-131620/selection/eaf89b7a4978a2d5dff9207e095c5b4468c549526ae50152b76881aa88e39c25" "q-131620/selection/1539229e458d355e21e88c2a6fb27d9d758077df151e24a4bac2e9b2b9fcc3da"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-131620" :question/id #uuid "0076c92d-fb02-5965-b0a4-bdf5c061df0f" :question/math-academy-id "q-131620" :question/problem "Consider the following system of linear equations:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned} & x-3y+z=4 \\\\  & 3x-8y+5z=10 \\\\  & -2x+6y-z=-5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the standard Gauss-Jordan method to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to reduced row echelon form." :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 3 & -8 & 5 & 10 \\\\ -2 & 6 & -1 & -5\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTransforming $M$ to reduced row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 3 & -8 & 5 & 10 \\\\ -2 & 6 & -1 & -5\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-3){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 6 & -1 & -5\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-2){R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}-{R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}+3{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & -23 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-131620/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "95a32907-8304-5dfd-8759-9e91503445bf"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-131620"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
